{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/PrivacyManifests"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Traffluent collects nothing on its own. It records only the events your app tracks and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"context your app turns on: every kind of automatic instrumentation and every standard enricher is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"opt in. It sends records only to the destinations your app gives a delivery, to endpoints your app"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"names. None of it is used for tracking as Apple defines it: no module links what it records with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"other companies’ data, reads the advertising identifier, fingerprints the device, or works around"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the user’s consent or App Tracking Transparency. Every manifest declares "},{"code":"NSPrivacyTracking","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and lists no tracking domains."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each module that can produce data of one of Apple’s collected data types ships a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"PrivacyInfo.xcprivacy","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" declaring it. SwiftPM and Bazel both put it in a resource bundle named","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Traffluent_<Module>.bundle","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which Xcode and rules_apple copy into your app, where Xcode’s privacy","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"report finds it. A module your app doesn’t link adds nothing to the report.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Required-reason APIs","anchor":"Required-reason-APIs","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No Traffluent module calls an API on Apple’s list of required-reason APIs, so every manifest’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"NSPrivacyAccessedAPITypes","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is empty. The list’s categories are file timestamps"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"code":"NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategoryFileTimestamp","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), system boot time"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"code":"NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategorySystemBootTime","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), disk space"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"code":"NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategoryDiskSpace","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), active keyboards"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"code":"NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategoryActiveKeyboards","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") and user defaults"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"code":"NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategoryUserDefaults","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"). The modules that come nearest:"}]},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Module"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What it calls"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Why none is a required-reason API","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"swift-system’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FileDescriptor"},{"type":"text","text":" ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"open"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"read"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"write"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"seek"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"resize"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"close"},{"type":"text","text":"), "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"fsync"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"unlink"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FileManager"},{"type":"text","text":"’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"createDirectory"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"setAttributes"},{"type":"text","text":" (the file protection class), "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"contentsOfDirectory"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isExcludedFromBackup"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"It reads no file’s timestamps, size from ","type":"text"},{"code":"stat","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", or the volume’s free space: a segment’s size is the offset ","type":"text"},{"code":"seek","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" returns at its end, and the store bounds itself by the bytes it has written.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FileManager.fileExists"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Data(contentsOf:)"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Data.write(to:options:)"},{"text":" in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FileVersionStore"},{"text":"; ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ProcessInfo.performExpiringActivity"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"It reads and writes the version file’s contents, never its attributes.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"sysctlbyname","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for ","type":"text"},{"code":"hw.machine","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"hw.model","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"ProcessInfo.operatingSystemVersion","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"Bundle.infoDictionary","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"Locale.current","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"NWPathMonitor","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"identifierForVendor","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"None is on the list; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Enricher.vendorIdentifier()"},{"type":"text","text":" is declared as collected data below."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tracker’s record timestamps ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Date"},{"type":"text","text":")"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A session’s inactivity is measured between records’ wall-clock timestamps, not from the system’s uptime."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Date.now","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Wall-clock time, not boot time."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ContinuousClock"},{"text":", the default clock of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"batch()"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The Swift runtime’s clock, which isn’t on the list.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GRDBPersistence\/documentation\/GRDBPersistence","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"GRDB"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"GRDB ships a privacy manifest of its own.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Every other module calls nothing near the list. Of the packages Traffluent depends on,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"swift-system’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Stat"},{"text":" API (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FilePath.stat()"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FileDescriptor.stat()"},{"text":") calls ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"stat"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"fstat"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"lstat"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"fstatat"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"statfs"},{"text":". Traffluent calls none of it. If your app does, your manifest","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"declares the file timestamp or disk space reason it needs.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Collected data","anchor":"Collected-data","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every declaration below is "},{"code":"NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeLinked","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (Traffluent links nothing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the user’s identity), "},{"code":"NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeTracking","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and has the one purpose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypePurposeAnalytics","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". A module declares a type only when it makes data of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that type itself; it is collected only once your app turns the module on and delivers the records"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"off the device."}]},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Module"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Data type","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What it makes, once your app turns it on"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext","type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Device ID (","type":"text"},{"code":"NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeDeviceID","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":")","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Enricher.vendorIdentifier()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":": the platform’s "},{"code":"identifierForVendor","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", as a "},{"code":"Sensitive","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"VendorIdentifierKey","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Other Diagnostic Data ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeOtherDiagnosticData"},{"type":"text","text":")"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Enricher.application()"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"device()"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"operatingSystem()"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"network()"},{"type":"text","text":": the app’s bundle identifier, version and build; the device’s model and form factor; the operating system’s name and version; and the kind of network connection."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Other Data Types ("},{"code":"NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeOtherDataTypes","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Enricher.locale()"},{"type":"text","text":": the user’s locale."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftUITracking\/documentation\/SwiftUITracking"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Product Interaction ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeProductInteraction"},{"type":"text","text":")"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"trackScreen(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"’s "},{"code":"ScreenViewed","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and the events "},{"code":"trackOnAppear(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"trackOnTap(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"trackChange(of:_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" track as the user moves through the app."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/UIKitTracking\/documentation\/UIKitTracking"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Product Interaction"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The events ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIControl.track(_:for:)"},{"text":" tracks when a control’s action fires.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AppKitTracking\/documentation\/AppKitTracking","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{